# Test: a reload whose static section declares NO route withdraws every route.
# VALIDATES: the config-apply callback acts on a delivered-but-empty section
#            instead of reading it as "nothing changed". parseStaticConfig
#            returns a nil slice both for a reload carrying no static section
#            and for one that declares no route, and the plugin separates the
#            two by tracking delivery beside the routes (pendingSection).
# PREVENTS: the defect this test was written for -- an operator empties the
#           static configuration, the commit succeeds, and every route stays
#           programmed in the kernel FIB with nothing to remove it.
#
# Non-vacuity: the `static` container STAYS in the config, holding no table.
# Deleting the whole section instead would withdraw the routes even against the
# defective code, because the server stops a plugin whose config root vanished
# (collectProcessesForRemovedConfigPaths) and routeManager.shutdown removes
# every route on the way out. That path proves nothing about the apply
# callback, which is where the defect lived.
#
# Requires a Linux kernel and CAP_NET_ADMIN for netlink route programming.
# The native setup fixture creates a dummy interface carrying both next-hop
# subnets so the gateways resolve in the bare VM. Declaring the capability
# makes an unprivileged Linux host skip instead of failing the `ip` operations.
option=needs-linux:caps=net-admin

stdin=ze-bgp:terminator=EOF_CONF
static {
    table default {
        route 10.10.0.0/16 {
            next {
                hop 192.168.1.1 { }
            }
        }
        route 172.20.0.0/14 {
            next {
                hop 10.0.0.1 { }
            }
        }
    }
}
EOF_CONF

option=env:var=ze.log.static:value=info

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture static/static-reload-empty-section-withdraws-setup
cmd=background:seq=2:exec=ze -:stdin=ze-bgp
cmd=foreground:seq=3:exec=ze-test fixture static/static-reload-empty-section-withdraws:timeout=15s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=static routes reloaded
expect=stdout:contains=withdrawn
